---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sunting itinerary"
  description="Editor markdown untuk itinerary perjalanan pribadi."
  noindex
>
  <div class="container container--wide" data-editor>
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="label">Itinerary · editor</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Sunting rencana</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">
        Tulis atau tempel markdown. Pratinjau di samping memakai tampilan yang sama dengan halaman
        baca. Semua tersimpan di peramban ini.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="itinerary-editor">
      <section class="itinerary-pane" aria-label="Editor markdown">
        <div class="itinerary-tools" role="toolbar" aria-label="Sisipkan format">
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="bold">Tebal</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="heading">Hari</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="list">List</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="check">Checklist</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="code">Kode</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="link">Tautan</button>
          <button type="button" class="editor-tool" data-insert="tag">Tag</button>
        </div>

        <label class="sr-only" for="itinerary-input">Markdown itinerary</label>
        <textarea
          id="itinerary-input"
          class="itinerary-input"
          data-input
          spellcheck="false"
          autocomplete="off"
          autocapitalize="off"
          placeholder={`---\nnama: Perjalanan Umrah\nmulai: 2026-11-17\nselesai: 2026-11-28\nzona: WITA · WIB · AST\n---\n\n## Hari 1 — Selasa, 17 November 2026\n- **10:30 WITA** — Berangkat dari rumah menuju bandara.\n- [ ] Paspor`}
        ></textarea>
        <p class="itinerary-status" data-status>Belum ada rencana</p>
      </section>

      <section class="itinerary-preview" aria-label="Pratinjau itinerary">
        <p class="label">Pratinjau</p>
        <div class="itinerary-preview__body" data-preview></div>
        <p class="itinerary-preview__empty" data-preview-empty>Belum ada isi.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="actions itinerary-editor__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/itinerary/">Lihat</a>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-import>Impor .md</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-export>Ekspor .md</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-copy>Salin</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-template>Template</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-clean>Rapikan artefak</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-restore hidden>Pulihkan cadangan</button>
      <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-delete>Hapus</button>
      <input
        type="file"
        accept=".md,.markdown,.txt,text/markdown,text/plain"
        data-file
        hidden
      />
    </div>

    <div class="notice itinerary-undo" data-undo hidden>
      <p data-undo-text>Rencana dihapus.</p>
      <div class="actions" style="margin-top:.75rem">
        <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-undo-action>Urungkan</button>
        <button class="btn btn--quiet" type="button" data-undo-close>Tutup</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <details class="itinerary-help">
      <summary>Format markdown</summary>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>Frontmatter</strong> (opsional): <code>nama</code>, <code>mulai</code> (YYYY-MM-DD),
          <code>selesai</code>, <code>zona</code>. Dipakai untuk judul dan penanda “Hari ini”.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Hari:</strong> <code>## Hari 1 — Selasa, 17 November 2026</code>. Variasi
          <code>Hari ke-1</code> atau <code>Day 1</code> juga dikenali.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Kegiatan:</strong> <code>- **10:30 WITA** — Berangkat…</code>. Titik dua atau titik
          (<code>10.30</code>), rentang (<code>10:30–10:45</code>), dan zona waktu boleh dihilangkan.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Checklist:</strong> <code>- [ ] Paspor</code>. <strong>Tag panduan:</strong>
          <code>#ihram</code>, <code>#tawaf</code>, <code>#sai</code>, <code>#tahallul</code>,
          <code>#wada</code>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Kode:</strong> <code>`08K`</code> atau <code>`FEZ8FB`</code> — disamarkan di halaman
          baca, bisa dibuka dan disalin.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <p class="footnote">
      <strong>Privasi.</strong> Rencana disimpan di <code>localStorage</code> peramban ini, tidak
      dikirim ke server. Ekspor <code>.md</code> untuk cadangan. Jangan menyimpan nomor paspor.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/itinerary-editor'
</script>
